  "content": {
    "id": "p20-q3-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "Using the common logarithm, evaluate each of the following correct to three significant figures:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p20-q3-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$(1.78)^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3.17$",
          "worked": "From the common-logarithm table:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}(1.78)^2 &= 2\\log_{10}1.78\\\\\\log_{10}(1.78)^2 &\\approx 2(0.2504)\\\\\\log_{10}(1.78)^2 &\\approx 0.5008\\end{align*}$$\nUsing the table in reverse:\n$$\\begin{align*}(1.78)^2 &\\approx 10^{0.5008}\\\\(1.78)^2 &\\approx 3.17\\end{align*}$$\nThe answer is correct to three significant figures.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p20-q3-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$(2.56)^2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$6.55$",
          "worked": "From the common-logarithm table:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}(2.56)^2 &= 2\\log_{10}2.56\\\\\\log_{10}(2.56)^2 &\\approx 2(0.4082)\\\\\\log_{10}(2.56)^2 &\\approx 0.8164\\end{align*}$$\nUsing the table in reverse:\n$$\\begin{align*}(2.56)^2 &\\approx 10^{0.8164}\\\\(2.56)^2 &\\approx 6.55\\end{align*}$$\nThe answer is correct to three significant figures.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
