          "worked": "From the common-logarithm table:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}(2.12)^3 &= 3\\log_{10}2.12\\\\\\log_{10}(2.12)^3 &\\approx 3(0.3263)\\\\\\log_{10}(2.12)^3 &\\approx 0.9789\\end{align*}$$\nUsing the table in reverse:\n$$\\begin{align*}(2.12)^3 &\\approx 10^{0.9789}\\\\(2.12)^3 &\\approx 9.53\\end{align*}$$\nThe answer is correct to three significant figures.",
